1
00:00:04,461 --> 00:00:12,661
Let patients book themselves — Public booking page — Share one link and let patients pick their own slot, inside the rules you set.

2
00:00:13,232 --> 00:00:19,976
This is the public booking page: one link per provider, opened with no login and no account.

3
00:00:19,976 --> 00:00:29,690
It carries your clinic name, the provider and the address — the patient knows they are in the right place.

4
00:00:29,690 --> 00:01:06,637
Only the types you marked bookable online appear — the rest stay for staff to book.

5
00:01:06,637 --> 00:01:19,201
Name, email and phone is all you ask for. The email is what carries the confirmation and the reminder.

6
00:01:19,201 --> 00:01:25,678
Booked. It appears on the clinic calendar immediately, and the desk never touched the phone.

7
00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:40,580
What you just did

8
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:51,260
Health | Efficiency | Growth — More in the Getting Started series — the next video is linked on screen.
